    "translation": "dividing the gathering."
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 100,
    "ayah_number": 6,
    "global_ayah_id": 6152,
    "translation": "Indeed, the human is ungrateful to his Lord."
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 100,
    "ayah_number": 7,
    "global_ayah_id": 6153,
    "translation": "To this he himself shall bear witness."
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 100,
    "ayah_number": 8,
    "global_ayah_id": 6154,
    "translation": "And indeed he is ardent for the love of good (wealth, becoming greedy)."
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 100,
    "ayah_number": 9,
    "global_ayah_id": 6155,
    "translation": "Does he not know that when that which is in the graves is overthrown,"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 100,
    "ayah_number": 10,
    "global_ayah_id": 6156,
    "translation": "and that which is in the chest is brought out,"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 100,
    "ayah_number": 11,
    "global_ayah_id": 6157,
